    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 33, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "嗯……啊，是艾玛亲啊……<br>\n那个，我睡眠不足嘛……", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Coco001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 35, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "想在审判开始之前，<br>\n稍微睡一会。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Coco002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 37, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（我还以为她去调查了呢……）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Ema002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 39, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Normal1,ArmR7,ArmL6"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 41, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我也是想调查来着。<br>\n但是现场实在不太想看。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Coco003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 43, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "然后呢，我本来想调查其他房间的，<br>\n结果看到了这张舒服的床。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Coco004"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 45, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 48, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这样啊……", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Ema003"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 50, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Angry1,ArmR1,ArmL1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啊，什么眼神啊，好烦。<br>\n睡觉又不犯法，你别管我了！", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Coco005"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "可可一脸不高兴地转过身去睡了。<br>", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（可可已经指望不上了……<br>\n　我还是做我该做的事吧）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Ema004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛开始仔细搜查室内。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（虽然这里不是杀人现场，<br>\n　可能没什么意义……）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Ema005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 65, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（这个房间，被翻乱了……？<br>\n　虽然应该不是可可干的……<br>\n　这到底怎么回事……？）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Ema006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 67, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这时，她发现了有一样东西掉在了地上。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv22_Narrative006"]}},
